  "description": "Graphics Mill is a high-performance image processing library for .NET with a strong focus on Web-to-Print workflows and template personalization. It is designed for production systems that need reliable rendering, advanced typography, PSD-based personalization, color-accurate output, and efficient processing of large images.\n\nKey features include advanced PSD parsing, rich text composition, multipage PDF generation, PDF/X-4 and PDF/VT support, rendering text as text or outlines, PDF layers, drawing with spot colors, TIFF extra channels, multipage TIFF support, lossless JPEG operations, and large image processing via the Pipeline API.\n\nGraphics Mill supports JPEG, PNG, GIF, TIFF, EPS, PDF, PSD, IDML, WebP, and other formats; RGB and CMYK color modes; 8-bit and 16-bit per channel images; metadata standards such as EXIF, IPTC, XMP, and Adobe Resources; and common operations such as crop, resize, rotate, flip, ICC color conversion, and image enhancements.\n\nIMPORTANT: This version is targeted for x64 environment. For x86 applications, please use the package named Graphics Mill Core (x86).",
